The updater scripts/update_oauth_resources.sh is adapted from the same
revision's scripts/update_oauth_resources.sh. It only refreshes Android app
versions used by this project, validates fetched data, and replaces the output
atomically after all requests succeed. The checked-in Android data still
comes from the revision above until refreshed locally.

Modified for this project on 2026-10-06: authentication and transport were
adapted to an instance-owned client with bounded requests, lazy token renewal,
serialized upstream access, cooldowns, and structured errors. Web rendering,
alternate authentication, and token rotation to bypass rate limits were
omitted. Reddit JSON is exposed through the gateway; independent clients
perform domain-model conversion. These adaptations are maintained source
copies, not an unmodified Redlib Cargo dependency.
